{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00823","headline":"郊庙歌辞 周宗庙乐舞辞 善庆舞 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 周宗庙乐舞辞 善庆舞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"卜世长，帝祚昌。\n定中国，服四方。\n修明祀，从旧章。\n奏激楚，转清商。\n罗俎豆，列簪裳。\n歌累累，容皇皇。\n望来格，降休祥。\n祝敢告，寿无疆。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00823.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00823","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}